        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the quick review - I suppose I can ask while you're here (was going to formalize it in the pr desc on ready, but who cares):\r\n\r\nThe matchit testing is quite unrigorous and I'm reallconcerned about making maintained/kept behavior match *exactly* to vim (it's like 3-4x the length of matchparen filled with index arithmetic garbage, as you can see). This includes maintaining most of the code structure in reference to the original implementation to reduce risk.\r\n\r\nI'd be happy to refactor the entire thing and have it immediately melded in with matchparen but I was considering it a *secondary step* in a later PR. Any advice on this?",
            "created_at": "2026-07-09T23:16:09Z",
            "html_url": "https://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/40664#issuecomment-4930391571",
            "id": 4930391571,
            "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/40664",
