        {
            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "The difficulty in keeping matchit compatible also lies in that it exposes several Vimscript API, which are difficult or unnecessary to implement in the rewritten Lua version.\r\n\r\nBased on @clason's suggestion, and considering our ultimate goal is to implement a feature-rich new version of the matchit plugin that works with matchparen, I feel we should directly write a brand-new version with these rich features and share code with the current matchparen.lua. A progressive iteration might not be unnecessary. Once it matures, we can drop matchit.vim directly.",
            "created_at": "2026-07-10T14:37:49Z",
