        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Not only is the code quality in #40675 much more maintainable than here but I see no reason to have this version of matchit ever be present in neovim. Closing.\r\n\r\nLet us either discuss in the tracker #39683, or you can move forward with a refined plan in #40675 we may iterate on.\r\n\r\nEDIT: discussion here https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/39683",
